<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial analyst Gary Helmig raised the rating on International Business Machines Corp to short-term and long-term buy from hold, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- set a 6-month price target of $180, sources said. Shares finished on Tuesday at $151.</p>
<p>-- Helmig declined to comment.</p>
</text>
